; Assignment to a field of a runtime-sized array's element must stick
; (the write-back-propagation fix in the VM's accessor lowering). The
; fixed-size sibling is the `assign_field_in_array_element` conformance
; test; this one lives in the cpu suite because runtime-sized locals
; (and `zeroed-array`) are CPU-only, so the conformance harness's GPU
; stage can't run it.
@cpu
(defn main []
  (let [@var arr: [vec2f] (zeroed-array 1)]
    (= (.x (arr 0u)) 1.)
    (print (.x (arr 0u)))))
